# Local environment variable hints (comment-only; no values belong in this file).
#
# Copy to `.env` or export variables in your shell for local use only. `.env` is
# ignored by git and must not be committed with real credentials.
#
# Ignore layout: docs/GITIGNORE_AND_LOCAL_ARTIFACTS.md
# Secrets and logging policy: docs/DESIGN_PRINCIPLES.md#secrets-policy
#
# Vendor LLM keys below apply only if you install replayt-langgraph-bridge[demo] or
# run integrator code that calls providers. The default CI [dev] install and pytest
# suite do not need these variables.

# --- Optional demo / integrator LLM credentials (set in your environment only) ---
# OpenAI API (optional demo / integrator graphs)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Anthropic API (optional demo / integrator graphs)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# LangChain / LangSmith-style tracing or hosted endpoints when used by integrator code
# LANGCHAIN_API_KEY=

# Other LANGCHAIN_* variables (endpoint, project, tracing, etc.): see upstream LangChain / LangSmith docs; not listed exhaustively here.

# --- Bridge-originated log redaction (see docs/LOG_REDACTION.md; compile_replayt_workflow(..., strict_redact=...)) ---
# REPLAYT_BRIDGE_STRICT_REDACT=
